# ============================================================
# FRONTEND ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (Required in Build/Deploy)
# ============================================================
# These MUST be configured in your deployment platform (Bolt, Netlify, Vercel, etc.)
# The VITE_ prefix makes them available to the frontend code

# Supabase Configuration - REQUIRED for production
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=your-supabase-url
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key

# Analytics (optional)
VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=your-google-analytics-id

# ============================================================
# EDGE FUNCTION SECRETS (Required in Supabase Dashboard)
# ============================================================
# These must be configured in Supabase Dashboard → Settings → Edge Functions → Secrets
# Do NOT add these as VITE_ variables - they belong on Supabase server side only

# Pica API - Notion Properties Integration
# PICA_SECRET_KEY_prop=your-pica-secret-key
# PICA_NOTION_CONNECTION_KEY_prop=your-pica-connection-key

# Pica API - Notion Blog Integration
# PICA_SECRET_KEY=your-pica-secret-key
# PICA_NOTION_CONNECTION_KEY=your-pica-connection-key

# Pica API - Notion Valuation Integration
# PICA_SECRET_KEY_val=your-pica-secret-key
# PICA_NOTION_CONNECTION_KEY_val=your-pica-connection-key

# Pica API - Notion Contacts Integration
# PICA_SECRET_KEY_contact=your-pica-secret-key
# PICA_NOTION_CONNECTION_KEY_contact=your-pica-connection-key

# ============================================================
# DEPLOYMENT CHECKLIST
# ============================================================
# 1. Configure VITE_SUPABASE_URL and VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY in your deployment platform
# 2. Configure all Pica secrets in Supabase Dashboard (not in deployment platform)
# 3. Verify Edge Functions are deployed in Supabase
# 4. Test all functions work in production
